[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4387292745","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119276#issuecomment-4387292745","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119276","id":4387292745,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBYDGSQ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T10:55:55Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T10:55:55Z","body":"It looks like the `XmlSerializer` loads the generated `TestXml.XmlSerializers.dll` assembly into the default context, so it won't be able to find your  `TestXml` assembly which is loaded into Godot's ALC (an isolated context Godot creates so it can reload it).\n\nYou can probably work around this with a custom assembly resolver:\n\n```csharp\nAppDomain.CurrentDomain.AssemblyResolve += (sender, args) =>\n{\n    if (args.Name.Contains(\"TestXml\"))\n    {\n        return typeof(TestNode).Assembly;\n    }\n    return null;\n};\n```\n\nThe fix would need to be implemented upstream in the .NET runtime where `XmlSerializer` is implemented, it would have to be changed so it loads the generated `TestXml.XmlSerializers.dll` assembly into the same ALC that your type is loaded into.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4387292745/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4387571716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119276#issuecomment-4387571716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119276","id":4387571716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBYUIBA","user":{"login":"GalaadMoutoz","id":26604586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjA0NTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26604586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz","html_url":"https://github.com/GalaadMoutoz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T11:41:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T11:41:15Z","body":"Thanks for your reply ! :)\nHow do you explain the fact that it works intermittently ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4387571716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4398494078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119276#issuecomment-4398494078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119276","id":4398494078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBiuxfg","user":{"login":"GalaadMoutoz","id":26604586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjA0NTg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26604586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz","html_url":"https://github.com/GalaadMoutoz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GalaadMoutoz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T15:28:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T15:28:15Z","body":"For anyone facing the same issue :\nI ended up ditching XmlSerializer & xscgen altogether.\n\nThere is a custom library that works like a charm called \"SharpXml\".\nhttps://github.com/kongo2002/SharpXml\n\nIt handles both class generation from .xsd and serialization using the more modern XObjects under the hood.\nSo 100% compatible with godot, once you import XObjectsCore.\n```\n  <ItemGroup>\n    <PackageReference Include=\"XObjectsCore\" Version=\"3.4.13\" />\n  </ItemGroup>\n```\n\nCheers, and thanks to @raulsntos for taking the time to look at my example. :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4398494078/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5722254281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119276#issuecomment-5722254281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119276","id":5722254281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVRKryQ","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T22:49:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T22:49:29Z","body":"Closing as per the comments above.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5722254281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed